<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Flowchart depicting a process where a prompt with multiple-choice question options \(A, B, C, D\) is input into an LLM \(large language model\), which then produces a generated answer. Arrows indicate the flow from the prompt to the LLM and finally to the answer.) /K 675 0 R /P 216 0 R /Pg 206 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
